refused: d177_finish_a_list.cy:23:5, line 23 column 5
23 |     return void;
   |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^
 what: this leaves with `$files` never given away or finished
 why:  a list that can grow on the heap is `must_Give`, and `std::coll::list.done` frees it with the allocator it came from, so a leak doesn't compile (D323, D325, D331)
